# DAC TA GIAO VIEC - chi tiet in 3D cho canh tay pushrod-arm (STLab). Don vi mm, goc do.
part: Piston_rod_Shoulder
project: pushrod-arm (canh tay robot in 3D, xi-lanh piston chay bang dong co 030 + ty ren M3)

frame: |
  He toa do XI-LANH (rieng cua chi tiet): truc X = truc ty (ty truot theo +X ra khoi ong), Y = be day ty,
  Z = be rong ty. Goc O nam tren truc ty. Moi so trong file nay theo he nay.

design: |
  Ty piston: thanh dai tiet dien chu nhat bo goc, mot dau la "got piston" nam trong ong xi-lanh (Housing),
  dau kia la MAT NOI (eye) de chot Pin_B xuyen qua. Trong ty co lo doc cho ty ren M3 va hoc giu dai oc M3:
  dong co quay ty ren -> dai oc (ket trong ty, khong xoay duoc) day ty truot ra/vao.

  1. Than ty: tiet dien 6.0 (theo Y, y -3..+3) x 8.0 (theo Z, z -4..+4), bo 4 canh doc theo X ban kinh 1.5.
     Dun doc X tu x = 27.38 (mat dau got piston) toi x = 94.78.
  2. Mat noi: tru tron truc Y, tam (x 99.78, z 0), ban kinh 6.0, y -3..+3 (cung be day ty), hop voi than ty.
     Lo chot xuyen theo Y, duong kinh 5.4 (chot Pin_B 4.8 -> khe 0.3/ben), dong tam mat noi.
  3. Lo ty ren: lo tron duong kinh 3.6 doc truc X (y 0, z 0), mo o mat dau x = 27.38, CUT (khong thung) tai x = 61.88.
     (Ty ren M3 = 3.0 -> khe 0.3/ben.)
  4. Hoc dai oc M3 (dai oc luc giac: rong 2 mat 5.5, day 2.4, goc 3.18):
     - doan x 30.03 .. 32.73 (day dai oc 2.4 + 0.3);
     - luc giac rong 2 mat 5.7 (5.5 + 0.2), XOAY sao cho 2 DINH nam tren truc Z (z = +-3.29) va 2 MAT PHANG song
       song mat XZ o y = +-2.85 -> dai oc nam gon trong tiet dien ty;
     - CONG them ranh ho mo len mat +Y: hop x 30.03..32.73, y 0..+4 (thoat ra khoi mat y = +3), z -3.29..+3.29
       -> dai oc tha tu tren xuong (theo -Y) vao ghe, nua duoi luc giac giu chong xoay.
  Ket qua: 1 solid duy nhat.

print: |
  In nam, MAT y = -3 (mat -Y) up xuong ban (mat +Y co ranh ho dai oc huong len). PETG, KHONG support.
  Lo ngang (lo 3.6 doc X) va mat noi deu phai tu in duoc - neu gate bao can support thi sua hinh (vd lo giot nuoc),
  KHONG duoc them support.

neighbors_info: |
  context.FCStd (cung he toa do) chua cac chi tiet XUNG QUANH - dung de kiem khe, KHONG sua chung:
  - Housing_Shoulder: ong xi-lanh, long ong 6.6 x 8.6 bo goc 1.8 (khe 0.3/ben voi ty).
  - LK_Nut_M3_piston_Shoulder: dai oc M3 dat dung vi tri trong hoc.
  - LK_Threaded_rod_M3_L45_Shoulder: ty ren M3 (duong kinh 3.0) trong lo 3.6.
  - Pin_B: chot qua mat noi.

